  <desc id="desc">Register allocation and V2-to-SVM ratio by rank. Ranks 20 through 21 remain below the VGPR and AGPR caps with no spills; ranks 22 through 24 hit both caps, spill to HBM-backed scratch, and lose their performance advantage.</desc>

